| OfxAccountId | 1234567890 |
| OfxAcctType  | CHECKING   |
When import target chosen : ImportTarget Vertical
| AccountPath | Assets:Checking |
Then account numbering is : AccountNumbering
| Path            | BankId    | AccountNumber |
| Assets:Checking | 053000196 | 1234567890    |
# Asked once. The number the bank uses is on the account now, so the rule
# above places next month's download without anybody being asked again.

Attributes AccountNumbering
Description The two things on an account that a download is matched against.
| Attribute     | Type        | Default |
| Path          | AccountPath |         |
| BankId        | Text        | none    |
| AccountNumber | Text        | none    |

