Scenario A transaction already imported, with no identifier, is matched on its day
Description The case a history brought over from Quicken makes ordinary. T1 came
# in with that history: it is cleared, because the bank had already
# posted it when Quicken was told about it, and it carries no FITID,
# because a QIF has none to carry. Downloading the same month from the
# bank reaches it again.
