| FromAccount | Assets:Checking       |
| ToAccount   | Assets:Checking Prime |
| Amount      | 3000.00               |
Then transactions are : ImportedTransaction
| Ref | SourceAccount         | Date       | Payee                      | Destination           | Amount   | Cleared | FitId      |
| T1  | Assets:Checking       | 2026-07-31 | TO PUGH K CHECKING         | Assets:Checking Prime | -3000.00 | Cleared | 2026073102 |
| T2  | Assets:Checking Prime | 2026-07-31 | FROM PUGH K PRIME CHECKING | Assets:Checking       | 3000.00  | Cleared | 2026073101 |
