Scenario Every proposal is confirmed in a dialog before anything is written
Description Nothing is paired without being shown and agreed to. The dialog
# lists each proposal with both halves, the gap in days, and the
# accounts, and offers approve, reject, and approve-and-remember.
Details A remembered rule can approve a later pair without asking again, and
# that is the only path that pairs anything silently. It exists because
# the user said so once, about those two payees in those two accounts.
