Description Three of 3,000.00 on three month ends and one of 30,000.00, which
# is what the two checking files hold. Each half pairs with exactly
# one other half, and a half once proposed is not offered again.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type     | Placeholder | BankId    | AccountNumber |
| Assets:Checking Prime  | Checking | false       | 053000219 | 1023711843105 |
