# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Remembering an approval
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Entity TransferMatchRule
Description A remembered approval, so that next month's import does not ask the
# same question again.
Details Learned from an approval, in the same way a payee rule is learned from
# categorising. It names the two accounts and the two payee texts, and
# it does not name an amount: the autopay is a different figure every
# month and that is the whole point of remembering it.
| Attribute   | Type        | Default | Notes                            |
| FromAccount | AccountPath |         |                                  |
| FromPattern | Text        |         | Matched against the name, Contains |
| ToAccount   | AccountPath |         |                                  |
| ToPattern   | Text        |         |                                  |
| Enabled     | Boolean     | true    |                                  |

Collection TransferMatchRules
| DataType          | Minimum | Maximum | Notes |
| TransferMatchRule | 0       | 10000   |       |

Scenario Approving a candidate offers to remember it
Description The offer is made, not taken. Whether a recurring autopay should
# always be paired is a judgement about the accounts, and the user is
# the one who knows.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type       | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking Prime  | Checking   | false       |
| Liabilities:WF Card    | CreditCard | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense    | false       |
| Income:Uncategorized   | Income     | false       |
When candidate approved : TransferCandidate Vertical CompareOnly
| FromAccount | Assets:Checking Prime       |
| FromName    | WF Credit Card AUTO PAY     |
| ToAccount   | Liabilities:WF Card         |
| ToName      | AUTOMATIC PAYMENT THANK YOU |
| Amount      | 3508.09                     |
Then rule offered is : TransferMatchRule Vertical
| FromAccount | Assets:Checking Prime       |
| FromPattern | WF Credit Card AUTO PAY     |
| ToAccount   | Liabilities:WF Card         |
| ToPattern   | AUTOMATIC PAYMENT THANK YOU |
| Enabled     | true                        |

