# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Checking the result against the bank
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Scenario The imported balance is checked against the one the bank states
Description LEDGERBAL is the strongest check there is that the import is right.
# A disagreement is reported rather than silently accepted.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense | false       |
Given transactions are : ImportedTransaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Destination | Amount  | Cleared | FitId |
| T0  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-01 | none        | 1750.00 | Cleared | none  |
Given import target is : ImportTarget Vertical
| AccountPath | Assets:Checking |
When transactions imported : OfxTransactions
| TrnType | DatePosted | Amount | FitId       | Name          | Memo | CheckNum |
| DEBIT   | 2024-01-15 | -45.00 | 20240115001 | HARRIS TEETER | none | none     |
When ledger balance checked : LedgerBalanceCheck Vertical
| Account     | Assets:Checking |
| StatedBal   | 1705.00         |
| StatedBalAt | 2024-01-31      |
Then balance check is : LedgerBalanceResult Vertical
| ClearedBalance | 1705.00 |
| StatedBal      | 1705.00 |
| Difference     | 0.00    |
| Agrees         | true    |

Attributes LedgerBalanceCheck
| Attribute   | Type        | Default    |
| Account     | AccountPath |            |
| StatedBal   | Money       | 0.00       |
| StatedBalAt | Date        | 2024-01-31 |

Attributes LedgerBalanceResult
| Attribute      | Type    | Default |
| ClearedBalance | Money   | 0.00    |
| StatedBal      | Money   | 0.00    |
| Difference     | Money   | 0.00    |
| Agrees         | Boolean | false   |

Scenario A disagreement with the stated balance is reported
Description The usual cause is a transaction entered by hand that the bank has
# not seen, wrongly marked cleared. The number is what makes it
# findable, so it is shown rather than hidden.
